{"unit_id":"yuanzhenqi__dsh-mobile-ui#card-zh","repo":"yuanzhenqi/dsh-mobile-ui","commit":"df802a3422b6d0dbc7d4c25b0581cbe27b0102de","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-ui 是面向手机浏览器的 DSH Web 界面插件，通过注入客户端模块调整窄屏布局，并在服务端注册文件上传路由。它把会话导航改为可展开抽屉，让对话区域使用全宽，调整设置面板、输入区和触控按钮，并支持选择不超过 50 MB 的文件上传到 DSH 主机。上传成功后，文件路径会写入对话输入框，供用户继续处理。适合在手机浏览 DSH Web、切换会话或把本地文件交给 Agent 的场景。安装使用 Web profile；不需要额外账号或 API 密钥，可选用 DSH_UPLOAD_DIR 设置上传目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:40-111","client.js:247-348","client.js:569-607","index.js:66-85"]}
{"unit_id":"yuanzhenqi__dsh-mobile-ui#card-en","repo":"yuanzhenqi/dsh-mobile-ui","commit":"df802a3422b6d0dbc7d4c25b0581cbe27b0102de","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-mobile-ui adapts DSH Web for phones with a session drawer, full-width conversations, touch controls, and a scrollable settings sheet. Users can upload files up to 50 MB to the DSH host; the path is placed in the composer. It needs no extra account or API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:40-111","client.js:247-348","client.js:569-607","index.js:66-85"]}
