{"unit_id":"yuanzhenqi__dsh-mobile-ui#feature-1","repo":"yuanzhenqi/dsh-mobile-ui","commit":"df802a3422b6d0dbc7d4c25b0581cbe27b0102de","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-ui 的功能「手机会话抽屉」：在窄屏下把侧栏作为抽屉显示，并提供按钮和遮罩切换。点击会话后抽屉收起，输入焦点也会被移除。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:53-123","client.js:515-567","client.js:645-675"]}
{"unit_id":"yuanzhenqi__dsh-mobile-ui#feature-2","repo":"yuanzhenqi/dsh-mobile-ui","commit":"df802a3422b6d0dbc7d4c25b0581cbe27b0102de","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-ui 的功能「窄屏布局适配」：在手机宽度下隐藏部分侧栏和标题栏控件，扩展对话与输入区，并把设置对话框改为可滚动的全屏面板。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:40-90","client.js:133-163","client.js:247-348"]}
{"unit_id":"yuanzhenqi__dsh-mobile-ui#feature-3","repo":"yuanzhenqi/dsh-mobile-ui","commit":"df802a3422b6d0dbc7d4c25b0581cbe27b0102de","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-ui 的功能「上传本机文件」：点击输入区的文件按钮并选择文件，可上传不超过 50 MB 的文件到 DSH 主机；上传后路径会填入对话框。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:495-503","client.js:569-607","index.js:28-63"]}
{"unit_id":"yuanzhenqi__dsh-mobile-ui#feature-4","repo":"yuanzhenqi/dsh-mobile-ui","commit":"df802a3422b6d0dbc7d4c25b0581cbe27b0102de","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-ui 的功能「键盘与视口适配」：切换会话时短暂抑制输入焦点，并读取 visualViewport 高度计算键盘占用空间，更新页面布局变量。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:622-644","client.js:680-696","client.js:732-748"]}
{"unit_id":"yuanzhenqi__dsh-mobile-ui#caveat-1","repo":"yuanzhenqi/dsh-mobile-ui","commit":"df802a3422b6d0dbc7d4c25b0581cbe27b0102de","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-ui 使用文件按钮上传至 DSH 主机，默认保存到 HOME 下的 .dsh/uploads；文件上限为 50 MB，也可设置 DSH_UPLOAD_DIR 更改目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:5-7","index.js:59-63","client.js:495-503"]}
